\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Per-model best Task~A configuration on the refreshed v2 split. For each model we report the layer/method combination that maximizes overall assignment accuracy on the held-out test set, with the threshold $\tau $ learned on the training split. Acc@1 is the threshold-free directory accuracy at rank 1; AssignAcc is the overall assignment accuracy; Exist.Acc and New.Acc are its decomposition into the existing-file and new-file subsets (see Section~\ref {subsec:acc-vs-assignment}).}}{6}{table.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:taskA_per_model}{{2}{6}{Per-model best Task~A configuration on the refreshed v2 split. For each model we report the layer/method combination that maximizes overall assignment accuracy on the held-out test set, with the threshold $\tau $ learned on the training split. Acc@1 is the threshold-free directory accuracy at rank 1; AssignAcc is the overall assignment accuracy; Exist.Acc and New.Acc are its decomposition into the existing-file and new-file subsets (see Section~\ref {subsec:acc-vs-assignment})}{table.caption.7}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Cumulative top-$K$ accuracy for Task B across the six models, reported as mean $\pm $ standard deviation over $M=5$ query/reference reseedings at a fixed v2 train/test split. Each cell gives the percentage of test queries whose labeled directory appears within the model's top~$K$ options at its best layer/method configuration. All models exceed 89\% by Top-1 and 95\% by Top-2.}}{6}{table.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:taskb}{{3}{6}{Cumulative top-$K$ accuracy for Task B across the six models, reported as mean $\pm $ standard deviation over $M=5$ query/reference reseedings at a fixed v2 train/test split. Each cell gives the percentage of test queries whose labeled directory appears within the model's top~$K$ options at its best layer/method configuration. All models exceed 89\% by Top-1 and 95\% by Top-2}{table.caption.10}{}}
